{"final": "Draft recommendation report sent to reviewer for approval:

Recommended vendor: Bluefin Logistics

Bluefin Logistics is the recommended vendor for Q3 logistics services. It meets all capacity and hub requirements (≥40 pallets/week, hubs in Lyon & Montreal) at the lowest total price of $48,200. Cedarpeak Shipping was excluded due to insufficient capacity, and Harborline Freight, while compliant, offered the highest pricing. Please proceed with contract negotiations."}
